  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provision of Rapid Financial Assistance to Vulnerable Households in Yemen</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project has the objective to provide immediate livelihood assistance to vulnerable households to meet urgent needs. Project activities will support vulnerable, crisis affected families who are not able to meet their basic needs, through direct cash assistance to provide an immediate boost to local economies and to contribute to improved livelihood conditions, that will ultimately support them in meeting their most urgent needs. Through this approach, the project will empower local communities and contribute towards reducing reliance on external aid. This project will directly support 1,690 vulnerable, crisis affected individuals (and another 10,140 members of their households) to have improved access to basic goods and services in the short term while simultaneously supporting long term livelihood opportunities for people in need.</narrative>
  </description>
